ucn 0.2 system: Shortly level: L0 origin: stated budget: 400
# System card: the task-independent core. It comes first in every projection, so it is a stable, cacheable prefix.
# L0 = kind, id, labels, one-line text. No relations or attributes. Global pins inline; scoped pins named.
goal Share: users share short links that keep working for years
goal Abuse [pin]: the service must not be usable to spread malware or phishing
system Shortly: URL shortening service
  container Web: single-page UI for creating links
  container Api: HTTP API for create, resolve, stats
  container Db: primary store
  container Cache: hot map from code to target
rule Links.CodeImmutable [pin]: a code never changes its target after creation
conflict RateLimitValue [pin]: ticket#14 says 100 links per hour; the code (api/guard.ts:44) uses 1000
more: req Blocklist [security], req RateLimit [security]
more: 5 req, 2 term, 3 actor, 3 component, 1 api, 1 config, 1 event, 1 env, 5 fn, 1 machine, 1 data, 3 decision, 2 convention, 3 test -> expand Shortly@L1
